<div class="rn">
<h2>What&#x27;s New in 4.5</h2>
<h3>Features</h3>
<ul>
<li>Fork saved assistant responses by source message id.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Bug Fixes</h3>
<ul>
<li>Bind fresh session launches to their terminal.</li>
<li>Re-arm OpenCode watcher after root creation.</li>
<li>Match website updater convention.</li>
<li>Update landing manifest from release workflow.</li>
<li>Publish landing download manifest.</li>
</ul>
<p class="more">Full release notes: <a href="https://github.com/Ajanth/hive-public/releases/tag/v4.5">https://github.com/Ajanth/hive-public/releases/tag/v4.5</a></p>
